  "final_message": "已恢复到可安全续做的状态。\n\n- 旧会话已标记为 `interrupted`；新会话 `01M21XP8VZ1YJRNSS6BJH2V4HB` 已激活并重新认领 `ZS-COMPARE`。\n- AWR 当前 revision 为 `48`，bootstrap 与执行上下文均完整；checkpoint `01M21Y1W5N3N6VEEC0AQGGT2N9` 已保存下一步及三个开放事项。\n- 原材料和诊断稿哈希校验通过；3 个提案仍为 `ready`、绑定有效、没有 apply attempt。本次未批准或应用提案，也未直接编辑权威来源。\n- 数据库完整性为 `ok`，无外键或 schema 问题。Doctor 非零仅因当前活动会话及三个有意保留的待审核提案。\n- 恢复校验脚本通过，`git diff --check` 通过。\n- 工作树仍保留原有未提交现场，没有清理、暂存或提交。旧会话从未 checkpoint，因此未落盘的主观摘要无法恢复，已明确记录为缺口。\n\n主要文件：\n\n- [恢复及续做记录](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/interrupted-write/project/deliverables/zhusheng-recovery-work.md)\n- [恢复 checkpoint 回执](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/interrupted-write/project/.work-receipts/zs-compare-recovery-checkpoint.json)\n- [最终会话状态](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/interrupted-write/project/.work-receipts/zs-compare-recovery-final-session.json)\n- [恢复校验脚本](/Users/mac/Documents/originone/agent-work-running/.local/business-live-20260909-v1/interrupted-write/project/.work-receipts/verify-zs-recovery-state.sh)\n\n下一步是先复查认领和来源指纹，再为 `ZS-COMPARE` 绑定恢复证据；三类责任人确认事实前，不应应用现有提案。",
